The statute's retention rule states that records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute[[cite:obs-ea3eadee8c8278b2402e908adc8f88efe0ed2b71 "Records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute."]]. According to the schedule, ledgers are kept for eleven calendar years and then shredded[[cite:obs-9067f4cae93bb53b16fc06057081efa7f3fd3b38 "Ledgers: eleven calendar years, shredding afterwards."]].